From 0cbf648d548a9bd16d3a8ea24076954a1483537c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sanjay Karinje <sanjay.karinje.8@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Nov 2025 20:11:53 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Add AI Writing Assistant for Writer (rewrite with AI)

Adds a new AI-powered text rewriting feature to LibreOffice Writer that
allows users to select text and have it rewritten using an OpenAI-compatible
API with different style options.

Feature:
- New menu entry: Format > Rewrite with AI
- Context menu entry when text is selected
- Dialog with style options (Improve clarity, More formal, More concise,
  Simpler language, Fix grammar)
- Shows original text and AI suggestion side-by-side
- User can edit the suggestion before applying
- Two apply modes:
  - "Apply as Tracked Changes" - creates redlines for review
  - "Replace Directly" - replaces without tracking

Configuration:
- Tools > Options > Language Settings > AI Writing Assistant
- Configurable API URL (OpenAI-compatible endpoints)
- API key and model name settings
- Enable/disable toggle

Technical:
- Uses libcurl for HTTP requests (guarded by HAVE_FEATURE_CURL)
- Configuration stored in officecfg Linguistic.xcs schema
- Follows existing DeepL translation feature patterns

